# .cursorrules

Cursor IDE pointer. All workspace rules in `AGENTS.md`. Persona in `SOUL.md`.

## Multi-File Trigger

>6 file changes → load skill `multi-file-change-protocol`.

## Rules (pointers)

- Style: 2-space TS, 4-space Python, single-quotes TS, double-quotes Python
- No `any`, no backup files, no `.env` writes
- Toolchain/routing/conventions: see `AGENTS.md`
- Style/safety/DRY: see `user-communication-preferences` skill
- Profile routing: code→code-architect, research→research-analyst,
  design→creative-director, planning→exec-assistant, teaching→patient-tutor,
  ops→adminbot, general→default

Run `hermes profile use <name>` matching task type BEFORE execution.
